satisfying all these basic conditions.And yeah, of course, data transfer from
app to app. This is most urgent, since we have the embedded engineer come over 
to test this thing.


For the modules like db, personal painter …, I would recommend working with 
windsurf - its really good at holding a large amount of context, and so giving
it a high level overview of the project makes it really effective. You might 
